@TravelApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5287

### 健康检查
GET {{TravelApi_HostAddress}}/health

###

### 按用户分页列出旅行记录（时间窗可选）
GET {{TravelApi_HostAddress}}/api/travels?userId=1&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### 按用户 + 到达时间窗过滤（UTC ISO 8601）
GET {{TravelApi_HostAddress}}/api/travels?userId=1&from=2026-05-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-06-01T00:00:00Z&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### 按 id 获取单条旅行记录
GET {{TravelApi_HostAddress}}/api/travels/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 创建旅行记录（已完成停留：departedAt ≥ arrivedAt）
POST {{TravelApi_HostAddress}}/api/travels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "locationName": "Shanghai",
  "latitude": 31.2304,
  "longitude": 121.4737,
  "arrivedAt": "2026-05-01T08:00:00Z",
  "departedAt": "2026-05-03T08:00:00Z"
}

###

### 创建旅行记录（进行中停留：省略 departedAt）
POST {{TravelApi_HostAddress}}/api/travels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "locationName": "Hangzhou",
  "latitude": 30.2741,
  "longitude": 120.1551,
  "arrivedAt": "2026-06-01T08:00:00Z"
}

###

### 更新旅行记录（补录离开时间）
PUT {{TravelApi_HostAddress}}/api/travels/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationName": "Hangzhou",
  "latitude": 30.2741,
  "longitude": 120.1551,
  "arrivedAt": "2026-06-01T08:00:00Z",
  "departedAt": "2026-06-05T08:00:00Z"
}

###

### 删除旅行记录
DELETE {{TravelApi_HostAddress}}/api/travels/2
